      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    asset_value = 120000\n    salvage_value = 10000\n    useful_life_years = 5\n    target_year = 3\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    depreciation_rate = 2 / useful_life_years\n    book_value = asset_value\n\n    for _ in range(1, target_year):\n        depreciation = min(\n            book_value * depreciation_rate,\n            book_value - salvage_value\n        )\n        book_value -= depreciation\n\n    third_year_depreciation = min(\n        book_value * depreciation_rate,\n        book_value - salvage_value\n    )\n    answer = round(third_year_depreciation)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
